# Wall of Shadows' `Mode$ CantTarget | ValidTarget$ Card.Self |
# SourceCanOnlyTarget$ Wall` (StaticAbilityCantTarget.java:108-129): Tunnel's
# only targeting part is `ValidTgts$ Wall` -- it contains Wall, no comma, no
# "nonWall" -- so Tunnel "can target only Walls" and Wall of Shadows is not a
# legal target. With no other Wall in play there is no legal target at all
# (CR 601.2c) and Tunnel is not cast: it stays in hand. castspell, not a
# queued action: a declined queued cast is a hard stop in passpriority.
startturn ai
advance 3
castspell ai 3
